  data\processed\docs\case-law\commonlii\LKCA\2001\96.md:1:# Virasinghe v. Virasinghe and Others - SLR - 1, Vol 1 of 
2002 [2001] LKCA 96; (2002) 1 Sri LR 1 (26 January 2001)
